herdr-pets is a port of VS Code Pets (https://github.com/tonybaloney/vscode-pets)
to the Herdr app.

Code
----
mods/pets/pets.js (each pet's behaviour table, colours and names) is generated
from the VS Code Pets source, and mods/pets/engine.js follows its state machine.
